      "text": "STORY ONE",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 24.46,
      "end": 25.88,
      "text": "THE FILLAID HAND",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 25.88,
      "end": 27.64,
      "text": "by Guida Malpassant",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 27.64,
      "end": 35.34,
      "text": "One evening, about eight months ago, I met with some college comrades at the lodgings of our friend Lewis R.",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 35.66,
      "end": 42.559998,
      "text": "We drank punch and smoked, talked of literature and art, made jokes like any other company of young men.",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 43.46,
      "end": 49.1,
      "text": "Suddenly the door flew open, and one who had been my friend since boyhood burst in like a hurricane.",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 49.86,
      "end": 52.039997,
      "text": "Guess where I come from, he cried.",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 52.92,
      "end": 55.539997,
      "text": "I bet on the Maybill, responded one.",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 55.98,
      "end": 56.76,
      "text": "No, said another.",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 57.1,
      "end": 57.94,
      "text": "You're too gay.",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 58.48,
      "end": 60,
      "text": "You come from borrowing money.",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 60,
      "end": 63.3,
      "text": "from bearing a rich uncle, or from pawning your watch.",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 63.78,
      "end": 68.74,
      "text": "You're getting sober, cried a third, and as you scented the punch in Louis's room,",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 69.03999999999999,
      "end": 70.86,
      "text": "you came up here to get drunk again.",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 71.639999,
      "end": 77.66,
      "text": "You're all wrong, he replied. I come from P in Normandy, where I have spent eight days,",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 77.92,
      "end": 83.38,
      "text": "and whence I have brought one of my friends, a great criminal, whom I ask permission to present",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 83.38,
      "end": 89.939999,
      "text": "to you. With these words he drew from his pocket a long, black hand, from which the skin had been",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 89.939999,
      "end": 92.899998,
      "text": "stripped. It had been severed at the wrist.",
      "check": false
    }
  ],
